// (`rewrittenReturnTypeUnder`), so a fourth rule fails to compile there rather than silently taking a
// neighbour's line.
// ⭐ **WHICH POPULATION `ProgramSignatures.nameInstancesFromDeclarations` IS CLAIMING INSTANCES FOR** —
// the two rounds of `deriveInstanceDisplayNames`, run in this declaration order because an unscoped spelling
// outranks a type-scoped one. See that walk for the ruling.
