// An `enum` and not the `bool` it replaced, for a reason the LANGUAGE settles rather than taste: a
// leading argument whose parameter has no default cannot be labelled (E2052), so a `bool` here
// reads `nameInstancesFromDeclarations(false)` at the call site — a magic value whose meaning lives
// only in the callee's parameter list. It is the same shape `RecordedReturnTypeRule` below takes
// for the same walk-with-two-rules problem.
